  id: 47
  missionName: THE OLD GUIDE
  missionType: ESCORT
  briefing: Nire knows the way to the temple stair. The way is not safe, she is not
    fast, and she stops for nothing. The water rises behind her.
  debrief: The guide sits down on the stair and will go no further. 'Below,' she
    says. 'It's all below.'
